Z||000018||batboy||02-21-2001||09:00 PM||||Technically, peanuts are NOT nuts. They are actually in the legume family and are more closely related to peas and beans than nuts. Nuts grow on trees and peanuts are low growing annual plants having pods that ripen underground.||||reg||1
