Z||000020||Cooter||02-21-2001||09:40 PM||||The reason for the warning is that some people have really bad allergic reactions to nuts and as a way to keep from getting involved in legal responsibilities, they just warn everybody that it may have some nut stuff inside. Where was that website that had all the reasons for really stupid warnings? Some are pretty funny. (Like the "Danger, High Voltage-No user serviceable parts inside")||||reg||1
